<title>AUSTRALIA: RUGBY UNION-QUEENSLAND BEAT NATAL 40-3 IN SUPER 12 MATCH.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-QUEENSLAND BEAT NATAL 40-3 IN SUPER 12 MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE, Australia 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Queensland beat Natal 40-3 (halftime 14-3) in a Super 12 rugby union match at Ballymore on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Natal - Penalty: Gavin Lawless.</p>
<p>Queensland - Tries: Penalty try, David Wilson, Ben Tune, Glen Panoho, John Eales, Jason Little. Conversions: Eales (5).</p>
